events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/katyanna/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/katyanna/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "katyanna", "id": 1137200, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjExMzcyMDA=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1137200?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/katyanna", "html_url": "https://github.com/katyanna", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/katyanna/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/katyanna/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/katyanna/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/katyanna/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/katyanna/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/katyanna/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/katyanna/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/katyanna/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/katyanna/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "be1e1c635d6549cd4f3b421ad5753885d3eee193", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/zalando-incubator/kube-metrics-adapter/commits/be1e1c635d6549cd4f3b421ad5753885d3eee193", "html_url": "https://github.com/zalando-incubator/kube-metrics-adapter/commit/be1e1c635d6549cd4f3b421ad5753885d3eee193"}]}, {"sha": "a382dbfe7b4a47db50132f2947bc0031d2de7dfe", "node_id": "MDY6Q29tbWl0MTUyMDY3Mzg0OmEzODJkYmZlN2I0YTQ3ZGI1MDEzMmYyOTQ3YmMwMDMxZDJkZTdkZmU=", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Jonathan Juares Beber", "email": "jonathanbeber@gmail.com", "date": "2021-05-21T07:00:39Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Jonathan Juares Beber", "email": "jonathanbeber@gmail.com", "date": "2021-05-21T12:29:11Z"}, "message": "Create ScalingSchedule collector\n\nThis commit adds two new collectors to the adapter:\n- ClusterScalingScheduleCollector; and\n- ScalingScheduleCollector\n\nAlso, it introduces the required collectors plugins, initialization\nlogic in the server startup, documentation and deployment example\n(including the helm chart). A new config flag is created,\n`-scaling-schedule`, and allows to enable and to disable the collection\nof such metrics. It's disabled by default.\n\nThis collectors are the required logic to utilise the CRDs introduced in\nthe #284 pull request. It makes use of the kubernetes go-client\nimplementations of a [Store][0] and [Reflector][1].\n\n[0]: https://pkg.go.dev/k8s.io/client-go/tools/cache#Store\n[1]: https://pkg.go.dev/k8s.io/client-go/tools/cache#Reflector\n\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Juares Beber <jonathanbeber@gmail.com>", "tree": {"sha": "0484f2f97fb4746df2870285d18911b0ecc83792", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/zalando-incubator/kube-metrics-adapter/git/trees/0484f2f97fb4746df2870285d18911b0ecc83792"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/zalando-incubator/kube-metrics-adapter/git/commits/a382dbfe7b4a47db50132f2947bc0031d2de7dfe", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCgAdFiEExs+GiZGKPvRFq0jxQdP0rORGV1EFAmCnp5cACgkQQdP0rORG\nV1EPgAv/bbsMNDe4N1+AmpsAc1lEgETtXC5bhKWnPr+gzpdo880WSXFx7PhDoVp5\n+tn5Qt4FX6uUOAESkpcVs8lxZMRDbXuhShCipvR0Q0mldQhH/Awjvd448bs7b7+B\nIO7DlU/FlIxC/f6yz61OOeriuYMGr1wcnQntBdhg88blPRqFxAAvYJDS0sfIRGvy\nRU9PAP8Im293VvmjwCMbqGqoaLI8hOQh9IacWbp0drj3lSRWhqCuE0eylqeqJakD\nQeAWno/FC8RM3ch5xsfpy1cllztJbNS6ZSJhmCOyGR7JrAEun8I3WvdFupYjzB02\nRid9Dn/OyD7+QE4Nc2AECZaPJt5vKZ1rm8Nl7XbxwYf5DFM+LRbsVODsU/I+tGoI\ncwEE8vwSe+OZmAndoKpGpDEWgou2p4S47Vf78kkKFuHvwoU7OjRV9xseaoAqEmOJ\n4JaJRshJCcePYXJp7HZxFlg/x36+seQYsjsvSr37llZ69CfOVyOe/zf5fpnQVkih\n+4XZ+8Se\n=aryP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----", "payload": "tree 0484f2f97fb4746df2870285d18911b0ecc83792\nparent 7a68304389d6914487775ac0840c1c5e1a41c5d0\nauthor Jonathan Juares Beber <jonathanbeber@gmail.com> 1621580439 +0200\ncommitter Jonathan Juares Beber <jonathanbeber@gmail.com> 1621600151 +0200\n\nCreate ScalingSchedule collector\n\nThis commit adds two new collectors to the adapter:\n- ClusterScalingScheduleCollector; and\n- ScalingScheduleCollector\n\nAlso, it introduces the required collectors plugins, initialization\nlogic in the server startup, documentation and deployment example\n(including the helm chart). A new config flag is created,\n`-scaling-schedule`, and allows to enable and to disable the collection\nof such metrics. It's disabled by default.\n\nThis collectors are the required logic to utilise the CRDs introduced in\nthe #284 pull request. It makes use of the kubernetes go-client\nimplementations of a [Store][0] and [Reflector][1].\n\n[0]: https://pkg.go.dev/k8s.io/client-go/tools/cache#Store\n[1]: https://pkg.go.dev/k8s.io/client-go/tools/cache#Reflector\n\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Juares Beber <jonathanbeber@gmail.com>\n", "verified_at": "2024-11-06T19:04:33Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/zalando-incubator/kube-metrics-adapter/commits/a382dbfe7b4a47db50132f2947bc0031d2de7dfe", "html_url": "https://github.com/zalando-incubator/kube-metrics-adapter/commit/a382dbfe7b4a47db50132f2947bc0031d2de7dfe", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/zalando-incubator/kube-metrics-adapter/commits/a382dbfe7b4a47db50132f2947bc0031d2de7dfe/comments", "author": {"login": "jonathanbeber", "id": 8309341, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgzMDkzNDE=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8309341?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/jonathanbeber", "html_url": "https://github.com/jonathanbeber", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jonathanbeber/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jonathanbeber/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jonathanbeber/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jonathanbeber/starred{/owner}{/repo}"